'''The Queen and the Saint''' (蜜江と聖者, ''Mitsue to Seija'', '''[[Queen Mother V|Mitsue]] and the Saint''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 1 Dark [[Catseye]] as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[I'll Be Bug (Merciless)|I'll Be Bug]] and [[Saintly Sister (Merciless)|Saintly Sister]] respectively. To unlock The Queen and the Saint, you must clear both The Old Queen and Papuu's Paradise.

